Versions of the external sources (recorded because these projects keep changing)
- MRST 2026a (GitHub SINTEF-AppliedCompSci/MRST, main at fa4ff98, 2026-10-09): source of the derived code above.
- open-DARTS: methods only, from the publications cited in docs/multiphase_fim.md; latest release when accessed
  on 2026-11-01: 2.1.0. No code copied.
- OpenGeoSys: mesh-format target only (.vtu export); latest release when accessed on 2026-11-01: 6.5.9.
  No code copied.
- IAPWS-IF97, revised release R7-97(2012); IAPWS 2008 viscosity; IAPWS 2011 thermal conductivity.
- MODFLOW 6 6.7.0 and FloPy 3.11.0: used to run the comparisons (not distributed here).
- PyVista 0.49.2: used to draw the 3D animations.

